# Search-tool ignore file (ripgrep, fd, ag, and the agent's Grep and Glob tools).
# examples/ holds finished reference builds: ~558k tokens of text that a build never needs.
# They stay in git as references: open one by path to understand a pattern, never to copy from it (workflow/GOTCHAS.md G43).
examples/

# input/ is git-ignored (client files never go into git), but a build must read it.
# Un-ignore it for search tools only. Ripgrep still drops these files when it is given
# several paths at once, so agents list inputs with `find input -type f` (workflow/GOTCHAS.md G55).
!/input/
!/input/**
